Now, let's see if you can optimize this method and make it more secure against potential hackers. Can you come up with a new encryption method that uses a combination of a randomly generated key and a mathematical formula to encrypt the message? Remember, the encryption method must be able to encrypt and decrypt the message accurately. Good luck!

